{"name":"Scarlet Rebels","hex":"#d44531","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"scarlet","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A brilliant red colour sometimes tinged with orange.","Cloth of a scarlet color."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a bright red colour.","Sinful or whorish."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/scarlet"},{"term":"rebels","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of rebel"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["third-person singular simple present indicative of rebel"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/rebels"}],"entries":[{"title":"Scarlet Rebels","blocks":[{"text":"Scarlet Rebels are a four-piece Welsh melodic rock band residing in Llanelli, South Wales. On 4 February 2022, they achieved their first Official UK Top 40 Album with their album See Through Blue, released on Earache Records, debuting at No. 7. This made them the first band from Llanelli to ever achieve a UK Top 40 Album. Scarlet Rebels followed this up with 'Where The Colours Meet' in 2024 which debuted at No. 15 in the Official UK Top 40 Album chart and also landed the band their first No. 1 Rock and Metal Chart entry."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scarlet_Rebels"},{"title":"Scarlet (Icon Comics)","blocks":[{"text":"Scarlet is a creator-owned comic book series written by Brian Michael Bendis and illustrated by Alex Maleev. It was initially published by Marvel Comics under the company's Icon imprint and later published by DC Comics under the company's Jinxworld imprint."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/56/Scarlet_1_Cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scarlet_(Icon_Comics)"},{"title":"Scarlet (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Scarlet is a bright red color, sometimes with a slightly orange tinge. In the spectrum of visible light, and on the traditional color wheel, it is one-quarter of the way between red and orange, slightly less orange than vermilion."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/52/RCMP-female-officer.jpg/330px-RCMP-female-officer.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scarlet_(color)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Nelson_Tower_in_Scarlet_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5188743.jpg/500px-Nelson_Tower_in_Scarlet_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5188743.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Nelson_Tower_in_Scarlet_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5188743.jpg/500px-Nelson_Tower_in_Scarlet_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5188743.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANelson_Tower_in_Scarlet_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5188743.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Anagallis_arvensis_2.jpg/500px-Anagallis_arvensis_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Anagallis_arvensis_2.jpg/500px-Anagallis_arvensis_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAnagallis_arvensis_2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Scarlet_ibis_arp.jpg/500px-Scarlet_ibis_arp.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Scarlet_ibis_arp.jpg/500px-Scarlet_ibis_arp.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AScarlet_ibis_arp.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Scarlet-Macaw.jpg/500px-Scarlet-Macaw.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_camp